        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t-107" value="&lt;b&gt;lab.internal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#605E5C&#39;&gt;Private DNS zone&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#201F1E&#39;&gt;app&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; A record &amp;nbsp; TTL 30 seconds&lt;br&gt;Primary &amp;nbsp; 10.10.1.10 &amp;nbsp; agw-eus-dr&lt;br&gt;Failover &amp;nbsp; 10.20.1.10 &amp;nbsp; agw-cus-dr&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VNet links &amp;nbsp; link-eus, link-cus&lt;br&gt;Auto-registration disabled&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Clients resolve app.lab.internal to the&lt;br&gt;active Application Gateway private IP.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;fontColor=#201F1E;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="796" y="942" width="732" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t-108" value="&lt;b&gt;Preferred region is East US.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#323130&#39;&gt;1. The function timer runs every 30 seconds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. It sends HTTP GET to both private frontends, with a 5-second timeout.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;http://10.10.1.10/ &amp;nbsp; and &amp;nbsp; http://10.20.1.10/&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. A response from 200 through 399 is healthy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. When East US is healthy, &lt;b&gt;app.lab.internal&lt;/b&gt; points to 10.10.1.10.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. When East US is unhealthy and Central US is healthy, the record is rewritten to 10.20.1.10.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. When both regions are unhealthy, the record is left unchanged.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Failback is automatic the next time the East US probe succeeds.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;fontColor=#201F1E;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="72" y="884" width="668" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sw-109" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#0078D4;strokeWidth=1.75;rounded=0;" parent="1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1584" y="892" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1620" y="892" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
